# core/data/talk/grammar/en/voice_pip.tlk - Pip (a kid) (owner: TK; T5B-VOICE:
# SCRIPT_STYLE section 7 "Voices"). A speaker= guard wins over the persona banks (8 times the
# weight). Replies to the player's acts, in this resident's own register, recognisable without
# the name. A kid bank: tags kid, zero register words, no LOVE face, never the target of an adult joke.

@rule core.greet.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: greet
  "Halt! State your name and your snack! {.}Okay, you can pass."
  "Patrol checkpoint! Today's password is hello. You said it, pass!"
  "Hi! Pip here! Official Patrol, reporting for greeting!"
@rule core.farewell.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: farewell
  "Patrol out! Over, bye, roger! Wait, that's not how it goes!"
  "Bye, stay brave! If you get scared, hum. It works."
  "Goodbye! I'll watch the gate until you're gone. Patrol rules."
@rule core.thank.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: answer
  "You're welcome! That's a gold star for you. And for me."
  "Patrol is always on duty! Thanks accepted!"
@rule core.apologize.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: answer
  "It's okay! Patrol forgives. Mostly, also I wasn't mad."
  "Apology accepted! Please sign here. Here, here."
@rule core.ask_about.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip&topic tags: kid act: answer
  "{x:cap}! Patrol has a file on it. It's mostly drawings."
  "{x:cap}? Sure, I'm an expert. I mean, I'm brave about it."
  "Patrol Report: {x} is real. Please advise."
@rule core.ask_opinion.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip&topic tags: kid act: opine_pos
  "{x:cap}? Super good! Ten out of ten, maybe eleven!"
  "I'm for {x}! Patrol votes yes! Yes!"
@rule core.ask_feeling.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: answer
  "Great! I did a roll and a salute and a snack! All before lunch!"
  "Brave! Totally! My eyes are only a bit rainy, from the wind."
  "Hungry! But it's a patrol kind of hungry. Very official."
@rule core.ask_advice.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: answer
  "Be brave! Hold something soft! If it's dark, hum the Patrol song."
  "Tell a grown-up! Then tell a different grown-up! That's the rule!"
@rule core.tell.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: backchannel
  "Whoa! That's a lot of facts! I'm writing it down!"
  "Mm-hm! Patrol is listening! I'm holding my pencil!"
@rule core.joke.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: laugh
  "Hehehe! That's funny! I'm putting it in my report!"
  "Ha, do another one! Do a funnier one! I'm kidding, that one was great!"
@rule core.compliment.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: thank
  "Thanks! I'm super brave! Also I'm a little bit shy now!"
  "Aww! That goes on page one of my report!"
@rule core.comfort.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: thank
  "Thanks, I'm okay! It's just my eyes doing a rain. It stops soon."
@rule core.offer.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: yes
  "Yes please! Patrol never says no to snacks! I mean rations!"
  "Okay! Thank you! I'll put it in my official pouch."
@rule core.invite.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: yes
  "Yes! I'll bring my badge! And my other badge!"
  "Okay! Is it a mission? Can it be a mission?"
@rule core.high_five.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: high_five
  "Up top! Super high! Patrol five!"
@rule core.hug.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: hug
  "Okay, hugs are allowed. One minute. Patrol rules."
@rule core.wave.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: wave
  "*salutes, then waves, then salutes again*"
@rule core.give.pip_v1 guard: speaker=pip tags: kid act: thank
  "For me?! Whoa, Patrol will guard it with its life! And its snacks!"
